%% AuthN/AuthZ flow

flowchart TB
  U[User]
  L[Login]
  S[Server session]
  MEM[Class membership check]
  UNI[University resolution PROPOSED]
  PERM[Permission check]
  API[API handler]
  RLS[RLS enforcement]
  RESP[Response or 401/403]

  U --> L --> S
  S --> MEM
  S --> UNI
  MEM --> PERM
  UNI --> PERM
  PERM --> API
  API --> RLS
  RLS --> RESP
